  "explanation": "The question asks for the year of the 'Battle of Ramla'. The source documents and original cards indicate there were multiple battles at Ramla. Document D2S1 and Card D2 explicitly state the 'third Battle of Ramla' occurred in 1105. Document D6 (specifically the Catalan text in D6S2) states 'La batalla de Ramla del 1102' (The battle of Ramla of 1102), referring to the second battle. Since the question does not specify which battle, both 1102 and 1105 are valid years for a 'Battle of Ramla' found in the text. The prior audits correctly identified these as potential answers, though they debated the scope; the text supports distinct events in both years."
